{"id": "EUVD-2026-103782", "enisaUuid": "dd0ed5ea-db6d-35fe-be00-d321c7eb2ea0", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nmodule: fix lost error code from codetag_load_module()\n\nIf codetag_load_module() fails, err is not set to reflect the failure\nand load_module() returns 0 after the module has been torn down.\n\nAlso, if the module is a livepatch, mod->klp_info allocated by\ncopy_module_elf() leaks on this error path.  Free it via a new\nlivepatch_cleanup label.", "datePublished": "2026-10-18T15:50:19", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-19T09:26:34", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/258310d59a82ea4854bfd9138682bbaac1153b19", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/bfc721eef5c13704efe6864c7da2ad4b0d75f60a", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/c79cf15eb35a4c703bf18f8c33c47e80dd660f8e"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-98842", "GHSA-j9p6-994v-55hw"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "02f0ac01-8c0c-348b-bb09-e3f03a8376cd", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "b6bbbb8ef48dde09c0dbd77121fa0f09b0237fec"}, {"id": "06d561f5-6a3e-3730-a2d3-fc31329f1e8d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "044d2aee6c575231ed4a24fb3d119bad0937488b <258310d59a82ea4854bfd9138682bbaac1153b19"}, {"id": "1edd8abb-a885-3d40-9a48-4f61a47fe570", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2.10"}, {"id": "24a3a9cf-b71e-30c9-b828-888628e8d4e3", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.3"}, {"id": "451a966f-801b-36a5-a5da-d17fc49f2534", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "77f877fd-051e-383a-92cf-2b15a6f2db2d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "044d2aee6c575231ed4a24fb3d119bad0937488b <c79cf15eb35a4c703bf18f8c33c47e80dd660f8e"}, {"id": "a2a0ac7c-6